                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "v1",
                    "ach_details",
                    ""
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Create a set of ACH details that can be used as a destination for ACH Payments.\n\nAll monetary values are represented in minor units, or the smallest unit of the currency with no decimal (e.g., cents). For example, $10.00 is represented as 1000.\n\n\n\n<i>How can we improve these docs?             <a href=\"mailto:docs+feedback@narmi.com\">Share your feedback.</a></i>"
              },
